// # Catalog QA Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Break-test drivers that ship with the catalog tree.
//
// Setup: Each proof is a hostile test for the published index. If a driver fails, the catalog fails to release. Do not import package payloads.
//
// Beats:
//   1. suite.oo — typechecks every driver twice and drives the catalog proof.
//   2. catalog_proof.oo — hello, echo, caps, and oocat (tools layer) lines, sha matches manifest.
//   3. sign_index.oo — re-sign index.sig after `opm bot .` rewrites index.
//
// Only suite.oo is re-exported here: every driver defines `main`, and the
// drivers have different entry signatures, so re-exporting more than one
// collides on the `main` prototype. The other two run as their own pages.

import "suite.oo";
